{
  "title": "Zesty Dense Algerian Lamb Kebabs",
  "description": "A spicy and dense post-workout dish featuring gorgonzola-dolce, perfect for a satisfying meal after a workout, with a shojin-friendly twist",
  "cuisine": "Algerian",
